    "long_instructions": "> Look back at the three sample cards (Neutral, Biased, Hidden Info).\r\n> 1. Pick one card and describe how its labels, tone, or layout might change what a user thinks about the item.\r\n> 2. Explain whether you think this design is fair to the user and why or why not.\r\n> 3. Write a one-line transparency label you could add to the card or page to make things clearer. Examples:\r\n>    * `Sorted by rating`\r\n>    * `Includes sponsored listings`\r\n>    * `Some reviews are promoted`",
